  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "code": "<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { useColorMode } from \"@vueuse/core\";\nimport { computed } from \"vue\";\n\nconst isDark = computed(() => useColorMode().value == \"dark\");\nconst shadowColor = computed(() => (isDark.value ? \"white\" : \"black\"));\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"flex h-56 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n    <h1 class=\"text-8xl leading-none font-extrabold tracking-tighter text-balance\">\n      Ship\n      <LineShadowText\n        class=\"italic\"\n        :shadow-color=\"shadowColor\"\n      >\n        Fast\n      </LineShadowText>\n    </h1>\n  </div>\n</template>\n",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "大号标题中需要突出个别单词的装饰效果时。",
    "希望文字效果不含持续动画、渲染开销低的场景。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "需要扫过式高光动画，改用 radiant-text。",
    "需要闪烁粒子点缀文字，改用 sparkles-text。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用。",
    "shadowColor 默认 black，暗色模式下需切换为浅色（示例中根据 useColorMode 动态传入）。",
    "默认渲染为 span，可用 as prop 改为其他 HTML 标签。"
  ],
